  "description": "One day, as I was just barely getting by, my mother was diagnosed with dementia. I had to take on the sole responsibility of caring for her, even though she no longer recognized her own child. As her condition worsened and those endless, hellish days dragged on, a mysterious email arrived.\n\n *“We’ll make your mother disappear.”*\n\n(Source: Naver, translated)",
